---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Configuration reference" current="/reference/configuration/">
  <article class="doc">
    <header class="doc-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Reference</span>
      <h1>Configuration</h1>
      <p class="lead">dollarlint reads TOML config from <code>.dollarlint.toml</code>. The validate command searches the target root unless <code>--config</code> points to a specific file.</p>
    </header>

    <h2>Starter config</h2>
    <pre><code>version = 1

[discovery]
include = ["*.json", "**/*.json", "*.yaml", "**/*.yaml", "*.yml", "**/*.yml", "*.toml", "**/*.toml"]
exclude = ["node_modules", "**/node_modules/**", "dist", "**/dist/**", "build", "**/build/**", "coverage", "**/coverage/**"]

[schemas]
fetchRemote = true
maxDepth = 8
concurrency = 8
azureResourcePruning = true

[schemas.fetch]
retries = 2
retryMinWait = "250ms"
retryMaxWait = "2s"

[schemas.catalogs]
enabled = false
failure = "warn"
strict = false

[[schemas.catalogs.sources]]
name = "schemastore"
format = "schemastore"
url = "https://www.schemastore.org/api/json/catalog.json"
enabled = true

[[schemas.associations]]
file = "settings/*.toml"
schema = "./schemas/settings.schema.json"

[timeouts]
fetch = "10s"
compile = "30s"

[output]
json = false
sarif = false
showSkipped = false
verbose = false
quiet = false
locations = false</code></pre>

    <h2>Discovery</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Key</th>
          <th>Purpose</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>include</code></td><td>File globs to consider during discovery.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>exclude</code></td><td>File and directory globs to ignore during discovery.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>followSymlinks</code></td><td>Follow symbolic links during discovery.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Schemas</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Key</th>
          <th>Purpose</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>fetchRemote</code></td><td>Allow fetching HTTP schemas.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>allowedDomains</code></td><td>Restrict remote schemas to exact or wildcard hosts.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>blockedDomains</code></td><td>Deny hosts even when they match the allowlist.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>maxDepth</code></td><td>Maximum external schema reference depth.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>concurrency</code></td><td>Number of concurrent validation workers.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>azureResourcePruning</code></td><td>Prune Azure Resource Manager schemas to referenced resource providers before compilation.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Catalogs</h2>
    <p>Catalogs map conventional filenames to schemas when a file does not declare <code>$schema</code> and no explicit association matches. SchemaStore is the default catalog source format.</p>

    <h2>Ignore rules</h2>
    <pre><code>[[ignore]]
file = "fixtures/*.json"
keyword = "required"
property = "legacyName"
reason = "legacy fixture kept for compatibility"</code></pre>
  </article>
</DocsLayout>
